{
 "total": 39.16,
 "frases": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "a": 0.15,
   "b": 1.952,
   "texto": "Your treehouse is slowly killing the tree!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "a": 2.072,
   "b": 4.358,
   "texto": "Hit like and follow. Flo built it in one weekend!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "a": 4.478,
   "b": 8.315,
   "texto": "Two hundred nails, and a rope around the trunk. It's not going anywhere!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "a": 8.435,
   "b": 11.91,
   "texto": "Every nail is a wound. Lots of small holes means lots of dead wood.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "a": 12.03,
   "b": 15.822,
   "texto": "And that rope? The tree grows, the rope doesn't. It strangles the bark.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "a": 15.942,
   "b": 17.362,
   "texto": "Wait. I'm hurting my tree?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "a": 17.482,
   "b": 20.357,
   "texto": "Builders say one big bolt beats a dozen small fasteners.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "a": 20.477,
   "b": 24.49,
   "texto": "Special treehouse bolts. Just a few, and big. The tree heals around them.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "a": 24.61,
   "b": 25.147,
   "texto": "And the rope?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "a": 25.267,
   "b": 27.472,
   "texto": "Take it off. Nothing should wrap around the trunk.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "a": 27.592,
   "b": 30.178,
   "texto": "And leave the tree room to grow, and to sway in the wind.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "a": 30.298,
   "b": 33.445,
   "texto": "Fine. My treehouse goes on a diet. Fewer nails.",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "a": 33.565,
   "b": 36.989,
   "texto": "Two hundred nails, or a few big bolts? Team Norm or Team Flo?",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "a": 37.109,
   "b": 39.16,
   "texto": "Follow for more backyard builds that won't fail!",
   "h": 0
  }
 ],
